Provenance

The topic sequence and conceptual scaffolding of this course are inspired by a
Packt Publishing textbook on information architecture. That book is the source
of the subject-matter outline only.

All prose, exercises, scenarios, answer options, explanations, and AI prompts in
this repository are original work written for this course. All worked examples
are fictional: the organisations, products, teams, metrics, research findings,
and quoted user statements are invented to illustrate a concept and do not
describe any real entity.

No text, figures, exercises, tables, or data were reproduced from the source
textbook or from any other copyrighted work. This license covers only the
original material in this repository.
